{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["אֲשֶׁר הֵם זֹבְחִים עַל פְּנֵי הַשָּׂדֶה — and there are some of them who go astray after the se'irim and not after HaShem."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {0 "Read לשמים as לשם, 'to Him,' i.e., to YHWH; the dagesh-less form לשמים reflects common medieval orthography for the preposition + 3mp pronominal suffix meaning 'to them.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:57.538399121Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}